  m_text: '<size=46><b>MUSIC</b></size>



    "Wallpaper" Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com)


    "Monkeys
    Spinning Monkeys" Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com)


    "Pixel Peeker Polka -
    faster" Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com)


    "Sneaky Snitch" Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com)


    "Volatile
    Reaction" Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com)


    "Voxel Revolution" Kevin MacLeod
    (incompetech.com)


    <size=46><b>SOUND EFFECTS</b></size>



    Sound effects
    and the two 3D hums are collected from pixabay, those are free to download.



    <size=46><b>TOOLS</b></size>



    Unity
    6.3  -  TextMeshPro

'
